              "text": "\n        2 Bab. 22.1—23.30; 2 Ke Ch. 34.1—35.27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Buno buli burume nibwo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aelesia Sefania mu siise nisio Yosia okhwa Amoni aba omwami owa Yuda. Sefania aba we lisaaye lio mwami Hesekia raraawe owa Amaria. Amaria aba raraawe owa Ketalia ne Ketalia aba raraawe owa Kushi ne Kushi aba raraawe owa Sefania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
